<h1>Upgrade pH7Builder</h1>
<p><strong>Important:</strong> This legacy upgrade guide has been superseded. Automatic in-place upgrades are currently unavailable. Do not use the historic upgrade wizard or overwrite a live production installation with an unreviewed archive.</p>
<p>Before any upgrade, review the published release notes, back up both files and database, and test the complete upgrade and restore process on a separate staging copy. Existing installations may require version-specific database migrations.</p>
<ul>
    <li><a href="https://github.com/pH7Software/pH7-Social-Dating-CMS/blob/18.x/docs/UPGRADING.md">Maintained upgrade guide and migration paths</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://github.com/pH7Software/pH7-Social-Dating-CMS/releases">Published releases and compatibility notes</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://github.com/pH7Software/pH7-Social-Dating-CMS/blob/18.x/docs/LAUNCH_CHECKLIST.md">Production verification checklist</a></li>
</ul>
<p>Keep custom modules, themes, configuration and user data intact. Never apply an unreviewed migration to a production database.</p>
